  "share": 0.2,
  "rule": "bundles in document order of their pivots; one in every consecutive block of 1/share drawn (seeded random), before slabs are packed; every non-pivot passage replaced by a unit of the same corpus, not in the bundle, sharing no root group outside the 50 most frequent with the pivot and at most one in all; matched on content-word count (within 25%, at least +-1) and mean root idf (within 10%, widened to 20%, 40%, any)"
 },
